{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHomoPredInstances\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkHomoPredInstances</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>))</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the instances of the `[grind hom_pred]` theorems triggered by `e`.\nEach instance is a pair `(proof, prop)` where `proof : prop`. A registered theorem\nwhose trigger matches `e`'s head symbol is instantiated with `e`'s trailing arguments;\ninstantiations that fail to elaborate (e.g. because the argument types do not match)\nare discarded.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHomoPredInstances","kind":"def","line":166,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHomoPredInstances","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L166-L185"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.addHomoPredAttr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">addHomoPredAttr</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">attrKind</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Attributes.html#Lean.AttributeKind\">AttributeKind</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Validates and registers a `[grind hom_pred]` theorem.\nThe conclusion of the theorem must contain an application whose trailing arguments are\nexactly the theorem's explicit parameters. The head symbol of this application is the\ntrigger for the theorem.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.addHomoPredAttr","kind":"def","line":140,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.addHomoPredAttr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L140-L164"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoPredTheorems\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getHomoPredTheorems</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorems\">HomoPredTheorems</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the homomorphism predicates tagged with the `[grind hom_pred]` attribute. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoPredTheorems","kind":"def","line":136,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoPredTheorems","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Met