Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem.arity","kind":"def","line":123,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem.arity","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L123-L123"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem.declName\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">HomoPredTheorem</span>.<span class=\"name\">declName</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem\">HomoPredTheorem</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Name of the theorem. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem.declName","kind":"def","line":120,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem.declName","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L120-L120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">HomoPredTheorem</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem\">Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem.mk","kind":"ctor","line":117,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L117-L124"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">HomoPredTheorem</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A theorem tagged with the `[grind hom_pred]` attribute. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem","kind":"structure","line":117,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L117-L124"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.addHomoAttr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">addHomoAttr</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">attrKind</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Attributes.html#Lean.AttributeKind\">AttributeKind</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Validates and registers a `[grind hom]` theorem, recording the source type of\n`=`-injection rules. See `validateHomoTheorem`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.addHomoAttr","kind":"def","line":107,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.addHomoAttr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L107-L115"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.validateHomoTheorem\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">validateHomoTheorem</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Ensures a `[grind hom]` theorem can be applied by `Sym.simp` without a discharger.\nInstance-implicit parameters are synthesized during rewriting and need not be\ndetermined by the left-hand side. Every other parameter must be inferable from the\nleft-hand side: it must occur in the left-hand side itself (as in\n`(BitVec.cast h a).toNat = a.toNat`, where `h` is instantiated by matching), or in the\ntype of a parameter that does (such parameters are assigned by type unification).\nA propositional hypothesis failing this test makes the rule conditional: it would have\nto be discharged when the rule is applied, so the rule would never fire. Any other\nparameter failing the test cannot be instantiated at all (e.g. it occurs only in the\nright-hand side).\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.validateHomoTheorem","kind":"def","line":37,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.validateHomoTheorem","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L37-L84"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoSourceTypes\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getHomoSourceTypes</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameSet\">NameSet</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the head constants of the homomorphism source types. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoSourceTypes","kind":"def","line":33,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoSourceTypes","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L33-L35"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.homoSourceTypesExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">homoSourceTypesExt</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/ScopedEnvExtension.html#Lean.SimpleScopedEnvExtension\">SimpleScopedEnvExtension</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameSet\">NameSet</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Extension collecting the homomorphism *source types*: the head constants `F` of the\ntypes `τ = F …` for which a `[grind hom]` rule translates `Eq τ`. The engine marks\nterms of these types as solver terms so that the E-graph reports their equalities and\ndisequalities (see `SolverExtension.markTerm`).\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.homoSourceTypesExt","kind":"opaque","line":21,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.homoSourceTypesExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L21-L31"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoTheorems\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getHomoTheorems</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/Theorems.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Theorems\">Sym.Simp.Theorems</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the homomorphism rules tagged with the `[grind hom]` attribute. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoTheorems","kind":"def","line":17,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getHomoTheorems","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L17-L19"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.homoExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">homoExt</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/Theorems.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.SymSimpExtension\">Sym.Simp.SymSimpExtension</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Extension backing the `@[grind homo]` attribute. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.homoExt","kind":"opaque","line":14,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.homoExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Homo.lean#L14-L15"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.AppBuilder","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Attr","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Theorems"],"instances":[{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.instInhabitedHomoPredTheorem","typeNames":["Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem"]},{"className":"BEq","name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.instBEqHomoPredTheorem","typeNames":["Lean.Meta.Grind.HomoPredTheorem"]}],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Homo"}